cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "pm25forecast: pooled deep ensembles for 48-hour urban PM2.5 forecasting"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the software and associated paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dadras
    given-names: Sina
repository-code: "https://github.com/sinadadras021/PM25-Ensemble-forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Four pooled recurrent base models with six ensemble strategies, chronological
  stacking, training-calibrated preprocessing and retrospective evaluation tools.
  This implementation follows the manuscript method; a synthetic smoke test
  does not reproduce or validate the manuscript's numerical results.
keywords:
  - PM2.5
  - air quality
  - ensemble learning
  - forecasting
